For YAW, something slightly different happens. A spinning rotor also tries to twist the drone in the opposite direction. That's why neighboring motors rotate in opposite directions.
So increasing one diagonal pair relative to the other creates yaw:
M1 and M3 ↑
M2 and M4 ↓
